# Mod/resourcepack JARs are delivered via the mods/*.pw.toml + resourcepacks/*.pw.toml metafiles
# (Modrinth CDN / GitHub Release URLs). They live in overrides/ only so build_mrpack can bundle them
# into the .mrpack — they must NOT be packwiz-indexed (they aren't committed → raw-fetch 404 = the
# "141 errored" bug). The committed custom jars (CoffeesAero*) also ship via their metafiles.
overrides/mods/
overrides/resourcepacks/

# Server-only secret config (Velocity forwarding secret) — must never ship to clients.
overrides/config/velocity/
